{"body":"## What\n\n- Adds the first deterministic meta-expression prototype as a library API, CLI, HTTP microservice, and static web playground.\n- Implements a links-network data shape with statement links, interpretation links, formalization links, dependency relation links, evidence links, support/refute relation links, provenance, and confidence results.\n- Supports the initial vertical slice:\n  - `1 + 1 = 2` -> computed true with confidence `1`\n  - `1 + 1 = 1` -> computed false with confidence `0`\n  - `Earth orbits the Sun` -> Wikidata-backed fixture evidence with provenance\n- Updates the issue #1 case study to use links-network terminology instead of graph/node/edge terminology.\n- Adds a detailed `ROADMAP.md` for Rust/WASM/React, real Links Notation parsing, Relative Meta Logic, live Wikidata, Doublets persistence, and the remaining long-term requirements.\n- Adds meta-theory source captures and PR feedback captures under `docs/case-studies/issue-1/data/`.\n\n## Why\n\nFixes #1 by moving beyond a documentation-only case study into a minimal working playground while keeping the larger architecture and deferred work explicit.\n\n## Screenshots\n\nDesktop static web prototype:\n\n![Desktop prototype](https://github.com/link-assistant/meta-expression/blob/issue-1-66f2990709b5/docs/case-studies/issue-1/prototype-web.png?raw=true)\n\nMobile static web prototype:\n\n![Mobile prototype](https://github.com/link-assistant/meta-expression/blob/issue-1-66f2990709b5/docs/case-studies/issue-1/prototype-web-mobile.png?raw=true)\n\n## Testing\n\n- `npm test`\n- `npm run check`\n- `scripts/check-file-line-limits.sh`\n- `git diff --check HEAD`\n- `bun test`\n- `deno test --allow-read`\n- CLI smoke: `node src/cli.js analyze \"1 + 1 = 2\" --format links`\n- Microservice smoke: `GET /health` and `GET /analyze?input=...`\n- Playwright render checks for desktop and mobile static web app, including console check and screenshot capture\n- `node scripts/validate-changeset.mjs`\n","commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-04-26T09:18:09Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-04-26T09:18:09Z","messageBody":"Adding .gitkeep for PR creation (default mode).\nThis file will be removed when the task is complete.\n\nIssue: https://github.com/link-assistant/meta-expression/issues/1","messageHeadline":"Initial commit with task details","oid":"22a14b90f4ec33d9d6bf85a249849e4db6f137f0"},{"authoredDate":"2026-04-26T09:31:30Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-04-26T09:31:30Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"docs: add issue 1 prototype case study","oid":"245b4c467a5ec3f0a1ac884044cbb1158f568e8b"},{"authoredDate":"2026-04-26T09:36:47Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-04-26T09:36:47Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Revert: Remove .gitkeep changes from initial commit","oid":"c87878f714e4bc525cbffe04c55a43af12fb0cb7"},{"authoredDate":"2026-04-26T10:18:17Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-04-26T10:18:17Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"feat: add meta-expression prototype","oid":"1656e5280874a0af083b4f08e42a718dd7960409"}],"files":[{"path":".changeset/bright-links-prototype.md","additions":6,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"README.md","additions":52,"deletions":218,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/case-studies/issue-1/ONLINE-RESEARCH.md","additions":125,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/case-studies/issue-1/README.md","additions":262,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/case-studies/issue-1/REQUIREMENTS.md","additions":129,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/case-studies/issue-1/ROADMAP.md","additions":332,"deletions":0,"changeTy